msgid "Automatic reads the hop count from the server reply and sets the decoy to expire that many hops short of the server. Manual always uses the TTL below."
msgstr "自动：根据服务器回包推算跳数，让伪造包在到达服务器前若干跳失效。手动：始终使用下面的 TTL。"

msgid "Manual value, and the fallback when the hop count is unknown."
msgstr "手动模式使用的值；自动模式推算不出跳数时也用它。"

msgid "Automatic mode: how many hops before the server the decoy expires."
msgstr "自动模式下，伪造包在距服务器几跳处失效。"

msgid "Running. Handshakes: %d, decoys sent: %d (automatic TTL %d, fixed TTL %d), errors: %d"
msgstr "运行中。握手 %d 次，已发伪造包 %d 个（自动 TTL %d 个，固定 TTL %d 个），错误 %d 次"

msgid "Not running. Traffic passes unchanged."
msgstr "未运行，流量原样放行。"

msgid "Addresses returned for these names (and their subdomains) are tracked. New HTTPS connections to those addresses get a decoy handshake first."
msgstr "这些域名（含子域名）解析出的地址会被记录。新建到这些地址的 HTTPS 连接会先发一个伪造握手。"

msgid "Before a client sends its TLS handshake to a listed site, the gateway sends a decoy handshake for another name. The decoy is built to be seen on the way out but dropped before it reaches the server. The real handshake then leaves unchanged. DNS answers are not altered and no certificate is needed on clients."
msgstr "客户端向名单内站点发出 TLS 握手前，网关先发一个指向其他域名的伪造握手。伪造包能被沿途设备看到，但到不了服务器。真实握手随后原样发出。DNS 应答不做修改，客户端也不用安装证书。"

msgid "Decoy drop method"
msgstr "伪造包丢弃方式"

msgid "Low TTL lets the decoy expire on the way to the server. A bad checksum makes the server discard it. Using both is safer, but some networks drop bad-checksum packets before inspection."
msgstr "低 TTL 让伪造包在去往服务器的途中失效；错误校验和让服务器丢弃它。两者同时用更稳妥，但有些网络会在检测之前就丢掉校验和错误的包。"

msgid "Repeat"
